  "body": "Get Your Combo Deal Now! Offers over $850,000 invited.\r\n\r\nYou'll be shouting \"I'm Lovin' It\" when you live here!\r\n\r\nPerfectly located in a modern development of similar townhouses and tucked into the vibrant Silverdale food, transport and business hub, there is so much on offer here.\r\n\r\nIt's an easy walk to the Hibiscus Coast Bus station for your simple city commute, or step next door to McDonald's Silverdale for your ultimate dining convenience!\r\nThe happiest neighbour you could ever have!\r\n\r\nON OFFER: \r\n- 4 bedrooms: 3 upstairs with a spacious, modern bathroom and a separate toilet. \r\nPLUS a  large bedroom downstairs (Ranch slider to a lovely, private deck area overlooking the garden and out to the Bronzewater Drive side of the house)\r\nAND a separate toilet. (Perfect for an older parent or boarder)\r\n\r\n- Modern kitchen and large, open plan lounge room- Very private.\r\n\r\n- Freestanding & Freehold property (No Body Corp  fees)\r\n\r\n- Dual road access with 1x allocated car park space\r\n\r\n- Partially fenced with a sunny aspect- small courtyard in front of the house.\r\n\r\nBonus offer: Delightful, distant country landscape views, especially from the upstairs rooms, and potential to create lovely gardens and put your stamp on this property.\r\n\r\nUse  this home however you choose. It has a flexible design and can suit a variety of lifestyles and purposes.\r\n\r\nIt's vacant and ready for you now!\r\n\r\nDon't delay.",
